    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nachtschicht (German for nightshift) is a horror job-simulator game set in an assisted living facility in the outskirts of Berlin, Germany. You are the only contact for the residents at night and you are responsible for keeping them safe. Pick up the phone when they need something, check the surroundings and hopefully the night will be quiet.</p>",
